<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Privacy | RIPL Wealth Money at Work</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/money-at-work/style.css"/></head><body><header class="header"><div class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/ripl-logo.png" alt="RIPL Wealth" width="112" height="48"/></a><a href="/">Return to the website →</a></div></header><main class="wrap section" style="max-width:800px"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy and your information</h1><p>This public informational website does not accept tax returns, account numbers, or financial documents. Do not send those items through email or ordinary contact forms. The tax evaluation buttons scroll to an information section where visitors can email Adam with a request or schedule an introductory conversation. They do not upload documents. After an introductory conversation, RIPL can provide instructions for securely sharing documents if a tax evaluation is appropriate. Do not email tax returns through ordinary, unencrypted email.</p><h2>Two-minute quiz</h2><p>The quiz runs in your browser. Your choices produce an on-screen educational starting point. This website does not send your individual quiz answers to RIPL or store them in a marketing database.</p><h2>Referral and campaign information</h2><p>When you arrive from an advertisement, referral source information in your URL (such as UTM campaign parameters) may be remembered for the duration of your browser session and carried into the external booking URL. No tax-return information is included in this tracking.</p><h2>Third-party links and videos</h2><p>YouTube, your calendar provider, and any separately arranged secure document-sharing provider have their own privacy practices. We do not currently enable a site analytics collector by default. Please consult the linked services' privacy information before entering data.</p><h2>Questions?</h2><p>Visit <a href="https://riplwealth.com/">riplwealth.com</a> for firm information and disclosures. <a href="/">Return to the landing page</a>.</p></main></body></html>
